      "title": "Who really judged the dead?（第1話）",
      "headline": "WHO REALLY JUDGED THE DEAD?",
      "text": "Who really judged the dead? Not Anubis alone. On this Egyptian papyrus, the heart is weighed on a scale. Anubis weighs. Thoth, the ibis-headed god, records the result. And if the scale balanced, Osiris received the dead. Judgment was a scene with many gods.",
