      "headline": "THE FIRST TENGU WAS A STAR",
      "text": "Before the long nose, the first tengu was a star. In the Nihon Shoki, finished in 720, a great star crosses the sky in 637, with a sound like thunder. A monk named Bin says it is not a falling star. It is a tengu, a celestial dog.",
