      "title": "Why a canine head?（第1話）",
      "headline": "WHY A CANINE HEAD?",
      "text": "Why does Anubis have the head of a canine? One idea, noted by the museum, starts in the cemeteries. Canines roamed ancient burial grounds and could disturb the dead. But a watchful canine could also be imagined as their guardian. It is an interpretation, not proof.",
